* August 15th - '''Alter Ego''' sign [[rate]] from [[IHC Esports]]. <ref name="rate&Gratisfaction">{{cite web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2025/09/14/rate-gratisfaction-complete-alter-ego-roster/news/|date=2025-09-14|title=rate 及 Gratisfaction 完成Alter Ego 名單|trans_title=rate & Gratisfaction complete Alter Ego roster|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|author=[[LemonFox]]|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]}}</ref>
* August 23rd - [[ImpressioN]] is acquired by [[Team Nemesis Asia]]. <ref name="-impression 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nmss_gg/status/1959224098678063471|title=just 1 CS team cannot lah, confirm must have Sinkie one also|date=2025-08-23|author=[[Team Nemesis]]}}</ref>
* September 4th - '''Alter Ego''' sign [[Gratisfaction]]. <ref name="rate&Gratisfaction"/>
* November 20th - '''Alter Ego''' part ways with [[tomiko]] and sign [[Polbandana]] as his replacement. <ref name="-tomiko">{{inside source|source=tomiko}}</ref>

|content5=
* March 10th - '''Alter Ego''' part ways with [[rate]] and sign [[BOROS]] as his replacement. <ref name="+boros">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/boroscs/status/2031234152155197591|title=Hello everyone|date=2026-03-10|author=[[BOROS]]}}</ref>
* June 3rd - '''Alter Ego''' part ways with [[Polbandana]]. <ref name="-Polbandana">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Polbandanacs2/status/2062132763734540517|title=Hello everyone|date=2026-06-03|author=[[Polbandana]]}}</ref>
* June 4th - '''Alter Ego''' part ways with [[Gratisfaction]]. <ref name="-gratisfaction">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/gratisfaction/status/2062438069899583579|title=Parted ways with Alter Ego|date=2026-06-04|author=[[Gratisfaction]]}}</ref>
* August 28th - '''Alter Ego''' signs [[PokemoN]], [[laxiee]], [[adeX]], and [[shadiy]] to complete their roster. <ref name="August 28">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AlterEgo_IDN/status/2093178058467578274|title=Welcome to La Familia, boys!|date=2026-08-28|author='''Alter Ego'''}}</ref>
}}

