|content1=
*August 31st - '''Aurora Gaming''' enter ''Counter-Strike'' with the signings of [[delus1onn]], [[KaiR0N-]], [[Lack1]], [[RAiLWAY]], [[sugaR]], [[starix]] and [[bullet (Russian player)|bullet]], with the latter two joining as coach and assistant coach, respectively. <ref name="Aurora Gaming">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1564931004866760704|title=It's finally here|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2022-08-31|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*October 11th - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[RAiLWAY]]. <ref name="-RAiLWAY">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-179073747_917|title=FREE AGENT|date=2022-10-11|author=[[RAiLWAY]]}}</ref>
*November 1st - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[sugaR]]. <ref name="-sugaR">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1587441812632993793|title=Today we bid farewell to @sugaRfromAz|date=2022-11-01|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*November 9th - '''Aurora Gaming''' acquire [[Norwi]] from [[forZe]]. <ref name="+Norwi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1587441812632993793|title=Today we bid farewell to @sugaRfromAz|date=2022-11-01|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*November 22nd - '''Aurora Gaming''' transfer-list [[KaiR0N-]]. <ref name="KaiR0N- TL">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1595110342967046145|title=KaiR0N- transferred from the main CS:GO roster and put up for transfer|date=2022-11-22|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*December 25th - '''Aurora Gaming''' acquire [[KENSi]] from [[forZe]]. <ref name="+KENSi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1607013431873347584|title=Welcome, @KENSI_CS!|date=2022-12-25|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*December 28th - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[delus1onn]] and acquire [[lattykk]] from [[VP.Prodigy]]. <ref name="-delus1onn +lattykk">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1608087775756300296|title=Welcome, @latt1kk!|date=2022-12-28|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>

